<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2000"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.060"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en-US"><text for="L1">She takes the media by storm with that invincible smile</text><text for="L2">Everyone's dying to know her mysterious secret</text><text for="L3">Even her ditsy moments are still on brand</text><text for="L4">Perfect — and such a liar</text><text for="L5">A genius idol</text><text for="L6">What'd you eat today?</text><text for="L7">What's your favorite book?</text><text for="L8">If you went out for fun, where would you go?</text><text for="L9">Didn't eat a thing</text><text for="L10">That's classified</text><text for="L11">Ask you anything</text><text for="L12">She just slips away</text><text for="L13">So coolly</text><text for="L14">Yet so brilliantly</text><text for="L15">A secret you almost see — sweet as honey</text><text for="L16">No, not that, no, no, no</text><text for="L17">Not that either, no, no, no</text><text for="L18">What's your type?</text><text for="L19">Who's the one?</text><text for="L20">Come on — answer</text><text for="L21">“I don’t really know what it means to love someone”</text><text for="L22">No one can tell if it’s a lie or not</text><text for="L23">Those words draw yet another person in</text><text for="L24">And make them fall in love all over again</text><text for="L25">Everyone's eyes are drawn to her</text><text for="L26">She's the perfect, ultimate idol</text><text for="L27">The kind you'll never see again</text><text for="L28">The first star reborn</text><text for="L29">With that smile, with those “I love you”s</text><text for="L30">She makes everyone fall under her spell</text><text for="L31">Those eyes, those words —</text><text for="L32">Even if they’re lies, that’s perfect love</text><text for="L33">Yeah, yeah, that girl's special</text><text for="L34">We were just extras from the start</text><text for="L35">Just supporting cast B, here to make the star shine</text><text for="L36">No way, everything's because of her</text><text for="L37">Give me a break</text><text for="L38">Of course there's envy and jealousy</text><text for="L39">This isn't a joke</text><text for="L40">That's exactly why it's unforgivable</text><text for="L41">I can't forgive her if she's not perfect</text><text for="L42">I can't forgive myself</text><text for="L43">I won't accept anyone but her, the strongest of them all</text><text for="L44">Everyone believes in and worships her</text><text for="L45">The strongest, most invincible idol</text><text for="L46">Not a single weakness to be found</text><text for="L47">She holds the first star within her</text><text for="L48">She can't, can't show any weakness</text><text for="L49">She never shows the parts no one wants to see</text><text for="L50">She's got to, got to be one of a kind</text><text for="L51">That's what true love is</text><text for="L52">I set the media buzzing with my signature smile</text><text for="L53">This is the one secret I keep buried</text><text for="L54">Building a career on the lie of "I love you"</text><text for="L55">This is my version of love</text><text for="L56">Even my sweat runs clear as aqua</text><text for="L57">These lids hiding a ruby beneath</text><text for="L58">Singing, dancing, whirling — I'm Maria</text><text for="L59">Yes, a lie is the purest form of love</text><text for="L60">I've never been loved by anyone</text><text for="L61">And I've never loved anyone</text><text for="L62">This lie of mine will someday become the truth</text><text for="L63">That's what I believe</text><text for="L64">Someday, I'll have it all</text><text for="L65">That's right, I'm a greedy idol</text><text for="L66">I want to love everyone</text><text for="L67">As my true self</text><text for="L68">So today, I lie again</text><text for="L69">Wishing for the day these words come true</text><text for="L70">And even now</text><text for="L71">To you — and only you — I couldn't say it</text><text for="L72">But I finally did</text><text for="L73">This is absolutely not a lie</text><text for="L74">I love you</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Ayase</songwriter></songwriters><transliterations><transliteration xml:lang="ja-Latn"><text for="L1"><span begin="0.649" end="1.456" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">muteki no</span> <span begin="1.456" end="1.926" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">egao</span> <span begin="1.926" end="2.105" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">de</span> <span begin="2.105" end="2.406" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">arasu</span> <span begin="2.406" end="2.859" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">medi</span><span begin="2.859" end="3.257" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">a</span></text><text for="L2"><span begin="3.551" end="4.149" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">shiritai</span> <span begin="4.149" end="4.532" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">sono</span> <span begin="4.532" end="4.975" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">himitsu</span> <span begin="4.975" end="5.370" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">misu</span><span begin="5.370" end="5.781" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">teri</span><span begin="5.781" end="6.135" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">asu</span></text><text for="L3"><span begin="6.135" end="6.801" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">nuketeru</span> <span begin="6.801" end="7.562" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">toko sae</span> <span begin="7.562" end="8.162" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kanojo no</span> <span begin="8.162" end="8.630" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">eri</span><span begin="8.630" end="8.933" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">a</span></text><text for="L4"><span begin="9.351" end="10.060" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/t